    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:663575623cbbe0ab9661aa4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，也请训练员对于今后的目标\n说几句话吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfdde67d0f4605381620d5d4fc2eeec1eff3d8000417ea88af6751da0f6eb40b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b19b4075dd99f4a65fa7f280",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将近一年半以来，爱丽速子\n竭尽全力（虽然有些事没告诉我），\n在闪耀系列赛闯出成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b36d927bb3a9123dd40bcb914a705d6ac6f57e243e3d61ea94f9699321e3e84a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c97cdc5c128fb21c9be84a79",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今后也会努力下去──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d32e80de351eb98a7196959d8b69746f20a3f57abbd0a4b9e33329d611e3bb10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb02944d1eff4776808ba74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032119.json",
      "json_path": [
