      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c287e6e31bf9a5345c9d5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好了，快让我听听你的古马级比赛规划吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e24e68c8db5cd3a633fde7fc94a4f235a0101127cd06c7f288e2795e40574e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67bd00273e5495241cb064f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今后我也会继续相信速子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24b493f9150f88312c86f845d28b54e1b2fe26736ab6441815f6dda008613777",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7f9b5620480ef7fd199bb71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我跟她约好了。\n那么，我该做的事……也不会变！",
      "source_fingerprint": "210908747034c2e2546c2420cbc387d48e03326df1f4d7e4fe41478de26d4735",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:762ea7a51c69810867747190",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我接到了晨间新闻节目的邀约，\n希望我跟爱丽速子担任节目嘉宾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2085fb5538dbc572fc366811e84fd674d833123c0511a000934a3a718f0e8ad3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
