    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e71a0bfb46193396937c3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87c97060d3a43e9dcba60adb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，等等，等一下！\n我还没说最重要的事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e50d81a593018241ef0680e8315c8cb29135be0298982e812edebb93196ff43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bae4b16951255656bb28f44",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我并没有跟她商量过今后的规划。\n是要说下次的目标或古马级的未来蓝图吗？\n我屏住呼吸看着她──",
